{"html": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008040/extras/12047516d2fab862f2eb768c3f5c7981.avif?t=1782481313\"></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>WHAT IS STARMAGEDDON?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Starmageddon</strong> is an online multiplayer, space dogfighting experience built for intense, competitive warfare. Two teams of five (5v5) collide in a vast battlefield where total freedom of movement across all axes reshapes combat itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008040/extras/ebb83521cf07864953d174c3414aed97.poster.avif?t=1782481313\"></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008040/extras/3b73c1c1a58ecec000c20cce8a4a5288.avif?t=1782481313\"></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>EVERY PILOT NEEDS A SHIP TO CALL THEIR OWN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In <strong>Starmageddon</strong>, players can forge countless combinations of hullwings, thrusters, weapons, and utilities through a modular ship construction system, tailoring each vessel to their combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008040/extras/3ea235bc205a632ef5872cd522e2a279.poster.avif?t=1782481313\"></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008040/extras/daee4773515e36c34d6b2a2822d26f5f.avif?t=1782481313\"></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\"You mean I can... destroy stuff?\"</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The battlefield in <strong>Starmageddon</strong> is alive and constantly evolving. Maps are filled with massive destructible space rocks to environmental hazards that can be torn apart mid-battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Combined with procedural generation shaping large parts of the arena, every match becomes a unique and unpredictable warzone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008040/extras/94b5ba5f23f28e7916d70a1e32111e16.poster.avif?t=1782481313\"></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008040/extras/fe886fa44cf19c1edf7fd85738a9832a.avif?t=1782481313\"></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>EVERY MATCH IS UNIQUE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">To keep every encounter fresh and chaotic, <strong>Starmageddon</strong> unleashes dynamic random events that can turn the tide of war in an instant. From devastating Fire Orbs to disorienting Radar Jams, no two matches ever play out the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008040/extras/d426f1bb1cb1236ffc76b14e85cb62b1.poster.avif?t=1782481313\"></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>JOIN THE FIGHT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play <strong>Starmageddon</strong> now and carve your name into the legends of the stars.</p>"}